        <briefdescription>
<para>Hamiltonian for interacting two spins. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>The Hamiltonian is given by (S1 * Tensor * S2) <parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
